"Allowed Gitea-only delta: a short header comment that the file is a Forgejo/Gitea mirror."},"840":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-46","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#intentional-non-parity","content":"GitHub-only"},"841":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-47","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#intentional-non-parity","content":"Why not mirrored"},"842":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-48","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#intentional-non-parity","content":"`.github/workflows/deploy-docs.yml`"},"843":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-49","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#intentional-non-parity","content":"Fumadocs static export → GitHub Pages (`gh-pages`, `.nojekyll`). Needs a chosen Gitea Pages / static host + secrets before a Gitea equivalent exists."},"844":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-50","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#intentional-non-parity","content":"`.github/dependabot.yml`"},"845":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-51","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#intentional-non-parity","content":"Dependabot is a GitHub product; use Renovate or manual bumps on Gitea. On GitHub it must open PRs against `development` (`target-branch`), not `main`. Enforced by `tests/bats/tooling.bats`."},"846":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-52","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#intentional-non-parity","content":"Docker Buildx still uses `cache-from/to: type=gha` for structural parity with GitHub. On pure `gitea-act-runner` hosts the GHA cache backend may no-op; prefer a persistent local Docker layer cache or registry cache on the runner if rebuilds stay cold."},"847":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-53","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#differences-from-github","content":"Runner labels may differ (configure in Gitea)."},"848":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-54","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#differences-from-github","content":"Secrets and variables are configured in Gitea UI (use the same logical names where applicable)."},"849":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-55","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#differences-from-github","content":"For self-hosted, ensure docker or the execution environment has the tools Bazel and hermetic dashboard tests need."},"850":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-56","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#differences-from-github","content":"Caching: mount persistent volumes for Bazel disk/repo caches; use `actions/cache` for npm/pip/Playwright when supported."},"851":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-57","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#differences-from-github","content":"Docs **publish** stays on GitHub Pages unless you add a separate Gitea deploy workflow."},"852":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-58","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#recommended-rollout-for-gitea-ultra-optimized","content":"Use the shipped `.gitea/workflows/ci.yml` (do not regress to a single job)."},"853":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-59","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#recommended-rollout-for-gitea-ultra-optimized","content":"Self-hosted runners (`gitea-act-runner` or compatible): mount persistent volume for `~/.cache/bazel-disk` and `~/.cache/bazel-repo` (and node\\_modules) for large cache hits across builds (key on `MODULE.bazel.lock` / `.bazelversion`)."},"854":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-60","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#recommended-rollout-for-gitea-ultra-optimized","content":"Use `actions/cache` for the same keys as GitHub where the runner supports it."},"855":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-61","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#recommended-rollout-for-gitea-ultra-optimized","content":"Runner labels: configure in Gitea admin (e.g. `self-hosted`, `linux`); use in `runs-on`."},"856":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-62","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#recommended-rollout-for-gitea-ultra-optimized","content":"Keep `.bazelrc` `--config=ci` for CI-oriented flags; raise resources on beefy self-hosted hardware as needed."},"857":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-63","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#recommended-rollout-for-gitea-ultra-optimized","content":"See also `.github/workflows/ci.yml` and `.bazelrc` for cache/parallel flags."},"858":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-64","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#caching--parallelism-tips-for-gitea","content":"Bazel: restore disk + repo cache in job steps (see `.bazelrc` and `setup-bazel`)."},"859":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-65","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#caching--parallelism-tips-for-gitea","content":"Non